1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,567
The bell above the door rings. Zoey's
already at the register.

2
00:00:04,267 --> 00:00:06,267
It rings again. Nobody walks in.

3
00:00:06,967 --> 00:00:12,500
Rule three. If the bell rings twice,
say, welcome in. Look at the register.
Never at the door.

4
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:14,833
Welcome in.

5
00:00:15,600 --> 00:00:19,700
Cold air brushes past your elbow. You
keep your eyes on the numbers.

6
00:00:20,400 --> 00:00:22,300
Smart. See you tomorrow, kid.

7
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:25,233
Zoey takes her coffee and stops at the
door.

8
00:00:25,933 --> 00:00:28,933
Did Marcus give you the notebook?
Good. Read it twice.

9
00:00:29,633 --> 00:00:31,700
Twice? There's only thirteen rules.

10
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:35,867
Some rules you read at night. Some you
read in the morning.
